meta {
  name: List articles
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/gallery?category={{galleryCategory}}&tag={{tag}}&includeUnpublished={{includeUnpublished}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  category: {{galleryCategory}}
  tag: {{tag}}
  includeUnpublished: {{includeUnpublished}}
  ~isFeatured: {{isFeatured}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  # List articles

  `GET /api/gallery`

  Return articles ordered by publishedAt descending.

  ## Authentication

  Public.

  ## Parameters

  | Name | Location | Meaning |
  | --- | --- | --- |
  | category | Query | Example: `{{galleryCategory}}`. |
  | tag | Query | Example: `{{tag}}`. |
  | includeUnpublished | Query | Example: `{{includeUnpublished}}`. |
  | isFeatured | Query | Disabled initially; enable in Params. Example: `{{isFeatured}}`. |

  ## Request body

  No request body.

  ## Response

  HTTP **200**.

  ```json
  [
    {
      "title": "Escena urbana de Guatemala",
      "slug": "urban-scene",
      "subtitle": "Artistas y espacios de la ciudad",
      "category": "EDITORIAL",
      "heroImageUrl": "https://example.com/portada.webp",
      "videoUrl": null,
      "videoSource": "NONE",
      "contentMarkdown": "## La escena\nTexto del artículo.",
      "readingTimeMinutes": 5,
      "subjectName": "Colectivo UV",
      "location": "Ciudad de Guatemala",
      "externalUrl": "https://example.com/artista",
      "eventDate": "2026-12-01T18:00:00Z",
      "isFeatured": false,
      "isPublished": true,
      "shopCollectionSlug": "urban-art",
      "shopCollectionTitle": "Urban Art",
      "tags": [
        "graffiti",
        "guatemala"
      ],
      "galleryImageUrls": [
        "https://example.com/detalle.webp"
      ],
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-14T12:00:00Z",
      "createdAt": "2026-11-14T12:00:00Z",
      "updatedAt": null
    }
  ]
  ```

  ## Errors

  - 400: invalid boolean query value.

  Automatic model validation can return ValidationProblemDetails; explicit controller errors use a message field. Authentication middleware errors may have no body.

  ## Notes

  Filters use AND. category is case-insensitive and tag uses lowercase exact membership. includeUnpublished defaults to false but true is publicly accessible. Omit isFeatured to include both states. No pagination.

  Examples contain fictitious data. The assertion checks the successful scenario; a missing record or insufficient permissions can produce a different documented status.
}
